比较 FY2025 10-K 与 2026 Q2 10-Q 的 Google Cloud 收入来源披露，指出变化及不能据此推断的内容。
DRAFT:
{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"FY2025 10-K把 Google Cloud 收入来源披露为三类：Google Cloud Platform、Google Workspace 和 other enterprise services；其中 Cloud Platform 以“consumption-based fees and subscriptions”为主，Workspace 为订阅，另有其他企业服务。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000451-6ce30e96","quote":"Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000452-43035749","quote":"Google Workspace includes subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000453-9711d965","quote":"other enterprise services"}]},{"text":"2026 Q2 10-Q 的披露在保留前两类的同时，新增了“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems”这一收入来源；因此，Q2 10-Q 对 Google Cloud 收入构成的明示来源比 FY2025 10-K 更细了一层。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000531-fa802653","quote":"Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000532-d23aecf2","quote":"Google Workspace includes subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000533-abd62671","quote":"Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000534-d9e74cdc","quote":"Other enterprise services"}]},{"text":"两期文件对 Google Cloud Platform 的核心表述一致，都是“consumption-based fees and subscriptions”，未见该主来源表述变化。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000451-6ce30e96","quote":"consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000531-fa802653","quote":"consumption-based fees and subscriptions"}]}],"limitations":["不能据此推断 TPU systems 的销售是否在 FY2025 10-K 时已存在、是否当时占比很小、或仅在 10-Q 才首次发生；只能确定 10-Q 明示了这一来源，而 10-K 未在该段落列出。","不能据此推断 Google Cloud 总收入、增速、毛利、或各来源占比的变化；这里比较的是披露口径，不是分项金额。","不能据此推断“Product sales”是 Google Cloud 的唯一新增业务、也不能推断其对全年收入的贡献规模。"],"findings":["变化点是：2026 Q2 10-Q 新增披露 Google Cloud 的“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems”。","未变化点是：Google Cloud Platform 仍主要来自消费型费用和订阅；Google Workspace 仍是订阅；仍披露其他企业服务。"],"stop_reason":"已比对两期原文，提取可核对的收入来源披露并说明可推断与不可推断范围。"}
REVIEW:
{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"FY2025 10-K 对 Google Cloud 的收入来源披露为：Google Cloud Platform 与 Google Workspace 两项业务共同构成收入，核心来源是消费型费用和订阅，覆盖基础设施、平台、应用和其他云服务。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000103-d95e78b6","quote":"Through our Google Cloud Platform and Google Workspace offerings"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000103-d95e78b6","quote":"generates revenues primarily from consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000103-d95e78b6","quote":"for infrastructure, platform, applications, and other cloud services"}]},{"text":"2026 Q2 10-Q 将 Google Cloud 的收入来源拆分得更细：除保留 Google Cloud Platform 与 Google Workspace 外，还新增了“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems”和“Other enterprise services”。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000128-aa97da5a","quote":"Google Cloud revenues consist of revenues from:"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000128-aa97da5a","quote":"Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000129-d23aecf2","quote":"Google Workspace includes subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000130-abd62671","quote":"Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000131-d9e74cdc","quote":"Other enterprise services"}]},{"text":"两期文件中，Google Cloud Platform 的表述口径基本一致，Google Workspace 也仍然是订阅型收入；变化主要在于 2026 Q2 10-Q 额外明示了 TPU systems 相关的产品销售。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000018","index_id":"didx-320f0efaace7b324","block_id":"block-000103-d95e78b6","quote":"Google Cloud Platform and Google Workspace offerings"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000128-aa97da5a","quote":"Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000129-d23aecf2","quote":"Google Workspace includes subscriptions"}]}],"limitations":["不能据此推断 TPU systems 销售在 FY2025 10-K 时是否已存在、是否首次发生、或是否规模很小；只能确定 10-Q 明示列出了该项，10-K 在该句未单列。","不能据此推断各收入来源的占比、增长率、利润贡献或全年收入结构变化；这里比较的是文字披露，不是分项金额。","不能据此推断“Product sales”是否为唯一新增来源，也不能推断其业务边界、客户范围或是否等同于芯片销售。"],"findings":["已纠正草稿中的一个潜在表述问题：FY2025 10-K 原文是“Through our Google Cloud Platform and Google Workspace offerings...”，并未在该句中像 10-Q 一样单列出“revenues consist of revenues from”式的项目列表。","变化点：2026 Q2 10-Q 新增披露“Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems”。","未变化点：Google Cloud Platform 仍以“consumption-based fees and subscriptions”为主；Google Workspace 仍为“subscriptions”。","草稿未充分区分“披露口径变化”与“业务本身变化”：10-Q 多列了一项来源，不等于该来源一定是 2026 年才开始发生。"],"stop_reason":"已核对两期原文并纠正草稿中对 FY2025 10-K 句式的概括偏差，同时保留不可推断范围。"}
